  "body": "See https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/16612#discussion_r1388011390, but `rooms` has the following nullable columns:\r\n\r\n* `is_public`\r\n* `creator`\r\n* `room_version`\r\n* `has_auth_chain_index`\r\n\r\nThe latter two were added to the table which is why they're nullable, but I suspect we can fill those in / add a constraint now?",
